OL,3,GNEWSAHydro defends bare-knuckle boxing
OL,4,Aevent after mass brawl outside
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's Ovo Hydro has defended the
OL,7,Fdecision to host bare-knuckle boxing
OL,8,Fmatches after a mass brawl broke out as
OL,9,Fcrowds were leaving the event.
OL,11,FAbout 9,000 people were at the venue on
OL,12,FSaturday night for the first ever
OL,13,FScottish show by Bare Knuckle Fighting
OL,14,FChampionship.
OL,16,FThree police officers were hurt and two
OL,17,Fmen were arrested during the large
OL,18,Fdisturbance, which spilled onto the
OL,19,Fnearby Clyde Arc bridge.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
