OL,3,GNEWSAHydro defends bare-knuckle boxing
OL,4,Aevent after mass brawl outside
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hydro said the event had been
OL,7,Fcarried out safely inside the venue
OL,8,Fitself, and that it would consider
OL,9,Ffuture shows by the promotion on merit,
OL,10,Flike any other event.
